Package: rfmismatch
Title: Random Forest Cross-Platform Reproducibility Testing
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Giuseppe", "Casalicchio", email = "giuseppe.casalicchio@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This is not a full R package. This DESCRIPTION file is used solely
    to document the R package dependencies required for the cross-platform
    reproducibility experiment. The project tests whether Random Forest
    predictions using the 'randomForest' and 'iml' packages produce consistent
    results across Linux, macOS, and Windows platforms.
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.6.0)
Imports:
    randomForest,
    iml
Encoding: UTF-8
License: MIT + file LICENSE
